Output ../img/search.gif
Set Height 460
Source common.tape

Hide
Type "cd /demo/project && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "ts -n TODO src"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Type "clear"
Enter
Type "ts -n -i 'todo|fixme' ."
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Type "clear"
Enter
Type "ts -c -F TODO src"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Type "clear"
Enter
Type "ts --files --glob '*.md'"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
